reset
create surface rectangle width 1000 height 1000 zplane 
webcut body 1 with plane xplane offset -25 imprint merge 
webcut body all with plane xplane offset 25 imprint merge 
webcut body all with plane yplane offset 50 imprint merge 
webcut body all with plane yplane offset -50 imprint merge 
webcut body all with plane xplane offset 0 imprint merge 


